OL,3,GNEWSAChurch revamp plan at 'impasse'
OL,4,Abut hope remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group aiming to transform a
OL,7,Fdilapidated church into a food hall
OL,8,Fsays it remains hopeful of making
OL,9,Fprogress despite reaching an "impasse"
OL,10,Fwith the building's owner.
OL,12,FThe former Methodist church in
OL,13,FWhitehaven, Cumbria, has been empty
OL,14,Fsince the mid-1990s and is in private
OL,15,Fownership, having most recently been
OL,16,Fsold at auction in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
