OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChurch revamp plan at 'impasse'
OL,4,Abut hope remains
OL,5,
OL,6,FRob Williams, who as director of the
OL,7,FWhitehaven Revival Community Interest
OL,8,FCompany (CIC) is leading the effort to
OL,9,Facquire the property, described it as
OL,10,F"needing an awful lot of work" with the
OL,11,Ftotal cost likely to run into several
OL,12,Fmillion pounds.
OL,14,FRepresentatives of the owner have been
OL,15,Fapproached for comment.
